[ProductInstall.GlobalRegistryChanges.Install]




AddReg=Product.Add.Reg,V9Reg.Core,V9Reg.Core.AddOnly, V9Reg.Univ,WMP.ARP, V9.RegPUI, WMPAddReg.PUI,WMPAddReg.OSPUI,V9Reg.XP, WMP.SPAD, WMP.Reg.IEHard, Reg.WMDMHandler, Fraunhofer.Reg, HideReg.WMP10.Qfe, Hide.WMC20.Uninstall
